  "description": "Free Fur All (FFA) was an annual anthro convention in the Tulsa area of Oklahoma, organized by Anthro West Open Organization Inc. (AWOO). The first event took place July 29 to 31, 2022, at the Glenpool Conference Center in Glenpool, Oklahoma, under the slogan \"Getting Back to Our Routes\", after U.S. Route 66. A second edition followed in July 2023. The planned 2024 edition, themed \"Cyberpunk\", was postponed indefinitely, and the organization expressed a wish to rebrand.",
